    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Pola Rekursi Tingkat Lanjut di UnifyWeaver\n\nBuku catatan ini mendemonstrasikan empat pola rekursi utama yang dapat dideteksi dan dioptimalkan oleh UnifyWeaver:\n\n1. **Rekursi Ekor (Tail Recursion)** - Perulangan iteratif dengan akumulator\n2. **Rekursi Linier (Linear Recursion)** - Panggilan rekursif tunggal dengan memoisasi\n3. **Rekursi Pohon (Tree Recursion)** - Beberapa panggilan rekursif pada bagian-bagian struktur\n4. **Rekursi Timbal Balik (Mutual Recursion)** - Predikat yang saling memanggil dalam siklus\n\n## Tujuan Pembelajaran\n\n- Memahami berbagai pola rekursi\n- Melihat bagaimana UnifyWeaver mendeteksi dan mengoptimalkan setiap pola\n- Membandingkan karakteristik kinerja\n- Mempelajari kapan harus menggunakan setiap pola",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "## Pengaturan\n\nInisialisasi lingkungan UnifyWeaver.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "% Muat inisialisasi\n['../init'].\n\n% Muat modul yang diperlukan\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/recursive_compiler)).\nuse_module(unifyweaver(core/advanced/pattern_matchers)).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Cannot find file: ../init",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Cannot find file: ../init</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "## Pola 1: Rekursi Ekor (Tail Recursion)\n\nRekursi ekor menggunakan akumulator untuk meneruskan hasil perantara, dan panggilan rekursif adalah **tindakan terakhir** dalam fungsi.\n\n### Contoh: Menghitung Item dalam Daftar",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "% Definisikan count_items dengan rekursi ekor\n:- dynamic count_items/3.\n\n% Kasus dasar: daftar kosong, kembalikan akumulator\ncount_items([], Acc, Acc).\n\n% Kasus rekursif: tingkatkan akumulator, lakukan rekursi pada ekor\ncount_items([_|T], Acc, N) :-\n    Acc1 is Acc + 1,\n    count_items(T, Acc1, N).  % ← Posisi ekor!",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "### Uji di Prolog",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "% Uji: hitung item dalam [a,b,c,d,e]\n\\+ \\+ (\n    count_items([a,b,c,d,e], 0, _N),\n    format('Count: ~w~n', [_N])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Count: 5",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Count: 5</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "### Periksa Deteksi Pola",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "% Periksa apakah terdeteksi sebagai rekursi ekor\n\\+ \\+ (\n    is_tail_recursive_accumulator(count_items/3, _AccInfo),\n    format('Tail recursive: ~w~n', [_AccInfo])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "'<meta-call>'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"error-result\" dir=\"ltr\">'&lt;meta-call&gt;'/1: Unknown procedure: is_tail_recursive_accumulator/2</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "### Kompilasi ke Bash",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
