      {
        "id": 14,
        "code": "## Pola 2: Rekursi Linier (Linear Recursion)\n\nRekursi linier memiliki **tepat satu** panggilan rekursif per klausa, dengan komputasi terjadi setelah panggilan rekursif kembali.\n\n### Contoh: Faktorial (Factorial)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "code": "% Definisikan faktorial\n:- dynamic factorial/2.\n\n% Kasus dasar\nfactorial(0, 1).\n\n% Kasus rekursif: tepat SATU panggilan rekursif\nfactorial(N, F) :-\n    N > 0,\n    N1 is N - 1,\n    factorial(N1, F1),  % ← Satu panggilan rekursif\n    F is N * F1.        % ← Komputasi setelah panggilan",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "code": "### Uji di Prolog",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "code": "% Uji: faktorial dari 5\n\\+ \\+ (\n    factorial(5, _F),\n    format('5! = ~w~n', [_F])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "5! = 120",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">5! = 120</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "code": "### Periksa Deteksi Pola",
        "type": "markdown",
