      {
        "id": 24,
        "code": "## Pola 3: Rekursi Pohon (Tree Recursion)\n\nRekursi pohon membuat **beberapa** panggilan rekursif untuk memproses berbagai bagian struktur.\n\n### Contoh: Penjumlahan Pohon (Tree Sum)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "code": "% Definisikan tree_sum untuk pohon biner\n% Format pohon: [Nilai, SubPohonKiri, SubPohonKanan] atau []\n:- dynamic tree_sum/2.\n\n% Kasus dasar: pohon kosong memiliki jumlah 0\ntree_sum([], 0).\n\n% Kasus rekursif: jumlah = nilai + jumlah_kiri + jumlah_kanan\ntree_sum([V, L, R], Sum) :-\n    tree_sum(L, LS),   % ← Panggilan rekursif pertama\n    tree_sum(R, RS),   % ← Panggilan rekursif kedua\n    Sum is V + LS + RS.",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "true.",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">true.</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "code": "### Uji di Prolog",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "code": "% Uji: tree_sum dari [5, [3, [1, [], []], []], [2, [], []]]\n%       5\n%      / \\\n%     3   2\n%    /\n%   1\n\\+ \\+ (\n    tree_sum([5, [3, [1, [], []], []], [2, [], []]], _Sum),\n    format('Tree sum: ~w (expected 11)~n', [_Sum])\n).",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "prolog",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "Tree sum: 11 (expected 11)",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">Tree sum: 11 (expected 11)</pre>"
      },
